ou get closer, like the hot and cold game. And the bunnies... probably won't bother you... too much. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370180/extras/e7b8a951469e698ac0d4abddfe6cf5bf.poster.avif?t=1739630692\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370180/extras/e7b8a951469e698ac0d4abddfe6cf5bf.webm?t=1739630692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370180/extras/e7b8a951469e698ac0d4abddfe6cf5bf.mp4?t=1739630692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When nighttime falls</strong>, you\u2019ll uncover the knowledge left behind by a previous expedition through the remnants of their diary entries, only discoverable with your super special blacklight lantern. Each snippet offers a glimpse into the discoveries and experiences of those who walked the islands before you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370180/extras/d2d0e45e82ee0424d48816f0fd943fc8.poster.avif?t=1739630692\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370180/extras/d2d0e45e82ee0424d48816f0fd943fc8.webm?t=1739630692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370180/extras/d2d0e45e82ee0424d48816f0fd943fc8.mp4?t=1739630692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farm and Create:</strong> Fung around by planting and matching mushroom spores to cultivate new variants. From real-life inspired mushrooms to wildly imaginative fungi, you\u2019ll plant them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370180/extras/6765cb3dd4e0205fbb8f919bbf510e87.poster.avif?t=1739630692\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370180/extras/6765cb3dd4e0205fbb8f919bbf510e87.webm?t=1739630692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370180/extras/6765cb3dd4e0205fbb8f919bbf510e87.mp4?t=1739630692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate and Design:</strong> Express your creativity by decorating Basecamp Island with charming lamps, sculptures, cute benches, archways with or without stringlights... How do you afford all of this? By selling mushrooms, of course!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370180/extras/040ec351fe2d8fea21c99ca42b20a049.poster.avif?t=1739630692\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370180/extras/040ec351fe2d8fea21c99ca42b20a049.webm?t=1739630692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370180/extras/040ec351fe2d8fea21c99ca42b20a049.mp4?t=1739630692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shrommzzz Ambience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shrommzzz dazzles with its bright, saturated colors and round, friendly designs. Immerse yourself in a world free of music but alive with the constant, soothing sounds of nature\u2014birds tweeting, bees buzzing, rain clattering, waves crashing, storms brewing, frogs chirping, leaves rustling and so much more!</p><